{"name":"Gossip","hex":"#9fd385","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Gossip","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Gossip"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gossip","blocks":[{"text":"Gossip consists of rumors or other information about the personal or private affairs of others. Gossiping is the sharing of gossip. Gossip often circulates within social groups and may serve social functions such as bonding, norm enforcement, or the sharing of reputational information. However, gossiping has often been viewed negatively by societies throughout history."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Pieter_Brueghel_the_Younger_-_Proverbs_%28detail%29_-_WGA03627.jpg/330px-Pieter_Brueghel_the_Younger_-_Proverbs_%28detail%29_-_WGA03627.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gossip","wikidata":"Q854648"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1b/No_chat.jpg/250px-No_chat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1b/No_chat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1b/No_chat.jpg/250px-No_chat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"This Soviet poster in war conveys the message: \"Don't chatter! Gossiping borders on treason\" (1941).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANo_chat.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Eugene_de_Blaas_The_Friendly_Gossips.jpg/500px-Eugene_de_Blaas_The_Friendly_Gossips.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Eugene_de_Blaas_The_Friendly_Gossips.jpg/1280px-Eugene_de_Blaas_The_Friendly